      "value": "Integrated Firebase Authentication with backend JWT verification (Firebase Admin SDK, Golang) and RBAC for USER/ADMIN roles; used AES encryption for sensitive data. Built a scalable Order Management and Inventory System with transactional consistency and idempotent APIs to prevent duplicate transactions. Designed a Wallet System using double-entry ledger for ACID-compliant transactions, with fraud detection, transaction validation, and audit logging. Integrated Stripe payments (sandbox), Firebase Cloud Messaging for real-time notifications, and Firestore for real-time order tracking/chat sync; built a WebSocket-based rule-driven chatbot in Golang for customer support workflows.",
