      "path": "/projects/1/description",
      "value": "Improved legacy code and MongoDB query performance by adding indexes and removing nested loops, cutting report generation time from 5 minutes to 25 seconds for 1 lakh (100,000+) records. Implemented Go concurrency patterns (Worker Pool, Fan-In/Fan-Out) for background PDF and Excel report generation. Resolved Kubernetes pod crashes from high-memory jobs using controlled goroutine execution and gopsutil-based memory checks, improving scalability under load. Integrated Elasticsearch/Kibana dashboards and alerting; built AWS S3 file upload, encryption, and pre-signed URL features. Developed an Expense microservice with approval workflows and Tesseract OCR-based receipt data extraction.",
